{"overview":"داستان حول دانش‌آموز سوم دبیرستان، جیرو یاکوئین، می‌چرخد که برای پروژه «آموزش ازدواج» کلاس، مجبور می‌شود با همکلاسی گیاروی خود، آکاری واتانابه، نقش یک زوج متاهل را تمرین کند؛ جیرو کاملاً با آکاری مخالف است، اما هر دو می‌دانند اگر موفق شوند می‌توانند شریک خود را عوض کنند تا به معشوقان خود برسند، بنابراین سعی می‌کنند همانند یک زوج متاهل کامل رفتار کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story centers on third-year high school student Jiro Yakuin, who gets saddled with his gyaru classmate Akari Watanabe for the class's \"marriage training\" project about practicing to be a married couple. Jiro is the complete opposite of Akari, but the two know that if they do well they will be able to switch partners to end up with their respective crushes, and so they force themselves to act like the perfect married couple.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2022,"poster":"/blGP300ByaQEtZ5r8V5bF75rxso.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"山下誠一郎","role":"Jiro Yakuin (voice)","photo":"/zym6WY3rxL4FdbHoLzG2CnqnR7.jpg","en":"Seiichiro Yamashita"},{"name":"大西沙織","role":"Akari Watanabe (voice)","photo":"/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg","en":"Saori Onishi"},{"name":"宮下早紀","role":"Shiori Sakurazaka (voice)","photo":"/5I1KqliJdfISImVZN7nw8DrqEdA.jpg","en":"Saki Miyashita"},{"name":"増田俊樹","role":"Minami Tenjin (voice)","photo":"/oMAk5Pu3aazmwFwiVOgyU7iW5ut.jpg","en":"Toshiki Masuda"},{"name":"野上翔","role":"Sadaharu Kamo (voice)","photo":"/9uLxicGhfnxNIfFrg2cKTy4Uf6P.jpg","en":"Sho Nogami"},{"name":"髙橋ミナミ","role":"Sachi Takamiya (voice)","photo":"/9SRX6yrHGtGEJxcnLyGFhOZkXSH.jpg","en":"Minami Takahashi"},{"name":"和氣あず未","role":"Natsumi Ohashi (voice)","photo":"/nxm4DLWv0BOcK2owvAz5yafSAXj.jpg","en":"Azumi Waki"},{"name":"小倉唯","role":"Mei Hamano (voice)","photo":"/vUuyLWde2CEd5G0oqeEzzFE6qqA.jpg","en":"Yui Ogura"},{"name":"内田修一","role":"Shu Terafune (voice)","photo":"/bh12DGF8laiTU58aLV